# SpherEarth / Balon ecosystem

Full map: [`C:\SpherEarthCanada\SPHEREARTH.md`](C:\SpherEarthCanada\SPHEREARTH.md) — **read it** before cross-repo or schema work.

## Repos (under `C:\SpherEarthCanada`)

| Repo | Own |
|------|-----|
| `Balon.Software.Models` | Shared Django models only (`core.*`) |
| `Balon.Model.Migrations` | **Only** place to makemigrate/migrate |
| `Balon.Admin.API` | Staff JWT API (news/media/staff/domain-invites; form **GET** only) |
| `Balon.Domain.API` | Domain JWT (invite-only) + **public** form upload/submit |
| `Balon.WebApp` | Public academy site → Domain forms API |
| `Balon.Admin.WebApp` | Staff UI → Admin.API |
| `Notification.Service` | Email gateway |
| `Terra.Corporate.Website` | Corporate site (not academy) |
| `Terra.Requirements` | Specs/docs |

Same MySQL `balon_core` for Admin + Domain + Migrations. Pin models git SHA in both APIs’ `requirements.txt`.

## Boundaries

- Schema → Models → Migrations → pin SHA in Admin **and** Domain
- Public forms → Domain (+ WebApp client); staff list forms → Admin
- No migrations from API repos; no public signup on Domain
- CORS: Domain `FRONTEND_URL(S)` = WebApp origin; WebApp `NEXT_PUBLIC_DOMAIN_API_URL` = Domain base
